  "description": "Fast main-content extraction for .NET 9/10/11 by the method of Mozilla Readability (the reader view of Firefox), built on z3l.FastHtmlParser: the article of a page without menus, sidebars, comments, ads and footers, as clean HTML, Markdown or text, with its title, author, date, excerpt, site name and image (JSON-LD, Open Graph, Twitter, Dublin Core). The content is sanitized. Checked against the 130 test pages of Mozilla Readability.",
